==Latin==

===Etymology===
Morphologically a derivative of {{term|mus|mūs|mouse|lang=la}} with diminutive meaning, thus "little mouse"; the "muscle" sense being a calque of {{etyl|grc|-}} {{term|sc=polytonic|μῦς|tr=mūs||mouse; muscle|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Classical}} {{IPA|/ˈmuːs.ku.lus/|lang=la}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|mūsculus|musculi|mūsculī|m|second}}

# Small [[mouse]].
# [[muscle|Muscle]].

